- S5.4;
- each S6 mirror of the 1531 cases;
- the S6 'once' and 'not at all when unused' assertions (the ptxas mutation at :667-668 covers only 'before');
- the S6 by-value check;
- the S8 correctness counts and rules.

Other steps show the convention being applied: S0.1, S2.11, S3.1 and S7 carry explicit '(no mutation: ...)' reasons.

